<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Prod-Art Tech shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Prod-Art Tech shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of electronics and paging service concern Prod-Art Technology (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares gained HK$0.23 or 33.33 percent to end at HK$0.92 on Tuesday. Volume was 151.64 million shares worth HK$122.51 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
